          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "Now a glance at this Table will show. that in respect of the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "numbers and relative positions of Stanzas, the copies marked",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "W. S. L. C. T. X. and G. form one group, K. D. M. R. P. and",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "A. form another, and Bo. Be., Y. and N. form a third. Of course",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "all members of each group do not coincide in all respects, but",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "on a general view, this distribution will be seen to be correct.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "Now the copy which has been taken as the basis of our text in the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "present edition belongs to the first group. And some of the reasons",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "which have led to this course may, perhaps, be mentioned here.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "In the first place, the only commentary of which I was aware",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 13,
          "text": "at the time when I first commenced this work was the com-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 14,
          "text": "mentary in C. In the second place, as will have been seen from",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 15,
          "text": "the remarks made above as to the parts of the country from",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 16,
          "text": "which the several MSS. have come, the prevailing text in",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 17,
          "text": "Western India seems to be that adopted in C.; as G. may be",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 18,
          "text": "taken in some measure to represent Gujarâth, W. S. and L. the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 19,
          "text": "Southern Maratha Country, and X. Nassick; while of the other",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 20,
          "text": "group, K. gives a Bengalee text; and although M. gives the text",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 21,
          "text": "current in the extreme South of the Presidency, and although too",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 22,
          "text": "D. P. and R. come from Gujarâth, still M. stands alone, and the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 23,
          "text": "latter three belong to only one province of Western India. Not-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 24,
          "text": "withstanding these circumstances, however, I should have preferred",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 25,
          "text": "to base my text upon the second family of MSS., since it appears",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 26,
          "text": "to have its representative in Eastern India, and in the Southern,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 27,
          "text": "Central, and Northern parts of Western India, and since there exists",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 28,
          "text": "a commentary on its text far superior to the other. But my",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 29,
          "text": "attention was attracted to the ambit of its currency some time after",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 30,
          "text": "I had made considerable progress in the work according to my",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 31,
          "text": "first plan.[*] I need scarcely add, however, that the whole of this",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
